tain A or switch to C. We need to provide reasoning.\n\nGiven the evidence, I think C still best. So we should change vote to C, providing reasoning that crew cooperation and reliability outweigh A's concerns, and stress data missing but not a disqualifier.\n\nThus we will change vote to Candidate C.\n\nWe need to reference Agent 3's points and our own facts: A's lack of openness, show-off, unfriendly, which are serious for crew cooperation. C's positive crew atmosphere and reliability are strong. Also note that we have no stress data for C, but also none for A, so cannot compare.\n\nThus we will state we now support Candidate C.\n\nNow produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE and METADATA_JSON."}
